<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
    <title>Certificate</title>
    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      .container {
        padding: 5px 55px 0 55px;
        font-size: 12px;
        text-align: justify;
      }

      .main-content {
        padding: 0 10px;
      }

      header {
        display: -webkit-box;
        display: -ms-flexbox;
        display: flex;
        -webkit-box-pack: justify;
        -ms-flex-pack: justify;
        -webkit-box-align: center;
        -ms-flex-align: center;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        width: 100%;
      }

      .header-logo img {
        width: 160px;
      }

      .header-qr-code img {
        width: 80px;
      }

      .application-date b {
        display: block;
      }

      .application-date {
        display: -webkit-box;
        display: -ms-flexbox;
        display: flex;
        -webkit-box-pack: justify;
        -ms-flex-pack: justify;
        justify-content: space-between;
        margin: 1.5rem 0rem;
      }

      .application-subject {
        margin: 2.5rem 0rem;
      }

      .application-header {
        margin-top: 2rem;
      }

      .application-header .dear-ceo {
        margin: 1rem 0rem;
      }

      .application-header-text {
        margin: 0.3rem 0rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }

      .application-info {
        margin-top: 2rem;
      }

      .application-list {
        width: 50%;
        line-height: 1.9;
        display: -webkit-box;
        display: -ms-flexbox;
        display: flex;
        -webkit-box-pack: justify;
        -ms-flex-pack: justify;
        justify-content: space-between;
      }

      .application-list b {
        display: block;
      }

      .application-ambassador {
        display: -webkit-box;
        display: -ms-flexbox;
        display: flex;
        -webkit-box-pack: justify;
        -ms-flex-pack: justify;
        justify-content: space-between;
        -webkit-box-align: end;
        -ms-flex-align: end;
        align-items: flex-end;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .application-ambassador .signature-container {
        width: 70%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: flex-end;
      }

      .application-ambassador .signature {
        text-align: center;
      }

      .application-ambassador .signature img {
        width: 50%;
      }

      .application-ambassador .signature hr {
        border: 0;
        border-bottom: 1.5px solid rgb(46, 45, 45);
        width: 60%;
        margin: 5px auto;
      }

      .application-ambassador .signature .desk-user {
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .cc {
        margin-top: 1rem;
        line-height: 2;
      }

      footer p {
        line-height: 1.9;
        margin-top: 1rem;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <main class="main-content">
        <div class="application-date">
          <b
            >Tracking
            No:<%=formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.trackingId)%></b
          >
          <div>
            <b
              >Date:
              <%=formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.certificateGenerateDate)%></b
            >
            <b
              ><%=formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.lastAmendmentDate)%></b
            >
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Subject: Request for Issuance of visa </b>
        </div>

        <div class="application-header">
          <p class="dear-ceo">Dear Sir,</p>
          <p class="application-header-text">
            With reference to the above mentioned subject, it is to inform you
            that
            <b
              ><%=formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.proposedProjectCompanyName)%></b
            >
            is a commercial or industrial unit registered with the Bangladesh
            Economic Zone Authority. The Company has requested for visa
            recommendation for the following expatriate:
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="application-list">
          <div>
            <b>Name</b>
            <b>Nationality</b>
            <b>Passport No.</b>
            <b>Designation</b>
            <b>Type of Visa Required</b>
          </div>
          <div>
            <b
              >:
              <%=formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.nameOfTheForeignNational1)%></b
            >
            <b>: <%=formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.nationality)%></b>
            <b>: <%=formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.passportNo)%></b>
            <b
              >:
              <%=formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.incumbentDesignation)%></b
            >
            <b
              >:
              <%=formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.typeOfVisaRequiredForTheIncumbentForeignNationals)%></b
            >
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="application-info">
          <p class="application-header-text">
            It would be highly appreciated if you would kindly issue the desired
            in favour of the above-mentioned national on proper verification of
            the papers upon submition of application for the same.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="application-ambassador">
          <div>
            <b>The High Commissioner/ Ambassador</b>
            <p>
              High Commission/ Embassy of the People's Republic of Bangladesh
            </p>
            <p>
              <%=formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.embassyHighCommission)%>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="signature-container">
            <div class="signature">
              <h3>Yours faithfully</h3>
              <%- formValue.deskUserSignature %>
              <hr />
              <div class="desk-user">
                <p>
                  <%= formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.deskUserFullName)
                  %>
                </p>
                <p>
                  <%=
                  formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.deskUserDesignation)
                  %>
                </p>
              </div>
              <div>Bangladesh Economic Zones Authority</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cc">
          <b>Cc to (formValue.Not According to Seniority)</b>
          <p>For kind information and necessary action :</p>
          <p>
            1. Senior Secretary/ Secretary, Ministry of Foreign Affairs,
            Segunbagicha, Dhaka
          </p>
          <p>
            2. Senior Secretary/ Secretary, Public Security Division, Ministry
            of Home Affairs, Bangladesh Secretariat, Dhaka
          </p>
          <p>
            3. Senior Secretary/ Secretary, Security Service Division, Ministry
            of Home Affairs, Bangladesh Secretariat, Dhaka
          </p>
          <p>
            4. Director General, Department of Immigration and Passport,
            Sher-e-Bangla Nagar, Agargaon, Dhaka
          </p>
        </div>
      </main>
      <footer class="main-content">
        <p>
          The above mentioned foreign national may be advised to approach in
          Embassy/ High Commission of Bangladesh in
          <b><%=formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.countryName)%></b> with
          the copy of his appointment letter and other related documents for
          obtaining<b>
            <%=formValue.utils.parseFormValue(formValue.typeOfVisaRequiredForTheIncumbentForeignNationals)%>,
            You are also advised to apply for his/ her work permit to this
            authority within 90 days after arrival in Bangladesh.</b
          >
          The company shall be responsible for all action of the expatriate
          during his/ her stay in Bangladesh.
        </p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
